## Install

**Local, unpublished (dev):** patch this plugin into a DSH profile
directly from its source:

```bash
pnpm dsh --profile <profile-name> --patch plugins/{{name}}/cordis.yml --dump-config
```

**Published:** once `{{name}}` is published, add it to a profile the
normal way:

```bash
dsh plugin --profile <profile-name> add {{name}}
```

## Try it out

Launch the DSH Web UI with `{{name}}` loaded live:

```bash
pnpm dsh web --patch plugins/{{name}}/cordis.yml
```

Opens `127.0.0.1:3080` with the plugin loaded and callable.
